; Race mix of new squad members, per faction and per worldspace (T24). A member's race is drawn once, when its squad is made, from
; the squad's home worldspace; existing members never change race. Weights are integers, and the ORDER is part of the draw: keep
; it when editing, or the same seed gives other races.
; Races: nord, imperial, breton, redguard, altmer, bosmer, dunmer, orsimer, argonian, khajiit, nordvampire, imperialvampire,
; bretonvampire, dunmervampire (the races the actor pool has faces for, tools/esp/build_esp.py).
; A faction missing from a worldspace section uses its [races] table; a faction missing from [races] uses the wanderer mix.

