; Solstheim (Dragonborn), the user (Oct 18): "races in Solesthiem favors dark elves among others with less high elves and wood elves".
; Dunmer first (Raven Rock and the ash wastes, ~50-60%); Nords next (Skaal, miners, Raven Rock settlers); some Imperials (the East
; Empire Company); Bretons, Redguards and Orcs low; Altmer and Bosmer rare (~2% each); Argonians and Khajiit rare.
; Skaal, Redoran and Reavers keep their [races] tables; caravans stay Khajiit; Forsworn, Thalmor and the Civil War sides do not live here.
